  hosgeldinMesajlari:
  - "Seninle ilgili \xF6\u011Frendiklerim bunlar {{isim}}. <sprite=0>"
  - "Magnus i\u015Flemci \u0131s\u0131s\u0131 \u015Fu an %{{sayi,50,78}}. Gayet iyi
    durumday\u0131z {{isim}}."
  - "Ve saatlerimiz {{tam saat}} dolaylar\u0131ndayken bilgi ekran\u0131nday\u0131z!"
  - "Seninle ilgili \u015Fimdilik bunlar\u0131 biliyorum."
  - "Hakk\u0131nda \xF6\u011Frendiklerim a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki gibi {{isim}}.
    <sprite=7>"
  - "Sana bug\xFCn {{kelime, George Orwell'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"hayvan
    \xE7iftli\u011Fi\" | Aldous Huxley'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"cesur yeni d\xFCnya\"
    | Antoine de Saint-Exup\xE9ry'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\xFC\xE7\xFCk prens\"
    | Malcolm Gladwell'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"outliers\" | Lev Tolstoy'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"insan ne ile ya\u015Far\" | Paulo Coelho'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"simyac\u0131\"
    | Marlo Morgan'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir \xE7ift y\xFCrek\" | \u0130hsan
    Oktay Anar'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"puslu k\u0131talar atlas\u0131\"
    | Sabahattin Ali'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\xFCrk mantolu Madonna\" | Grigori
    Petrov'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"beyaz zambaklar \xFClkesinde\" | Jos\xE9 Mauro
    de Vasconcelos'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\u015Feker portakal\u0131\" | Fyodor
    Dostoyevski'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"yeralt\u0131ndan notlar\" | Nancy H.
    Kleinbaum'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\xF6l\xFC ozanlar derne\u011Fi\" | Jos\xE9
    Saramago'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\xF6rl\xFCk\" | Stefan Zweig'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"satran\xE7\" | Lev Tolstoy'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"sava\u015F ve bar\u0131\u015F\"
    | Victor Hugo'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Notre Dame'\u0131n kamburu\" | Victor
    Hugo'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"sefiller\" | Miguel de Cervantes'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"Don Ki\u015Fot\" | Mark Twain'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"insan nedir\" | Edgar
    Allan Poe'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"morgue soka\u011F\u0131 cinayeti\" | Alper
    Can\u0131g\xFCz'\xFCn yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"kan ve g\xFCl\" | Murat Mente\u015F'in
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"dubl\xF6r\xFCn dilemmas\u0131\" | Fr\xE9d\xE9ric Gros'un
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"y\xFCr\xFCmenin felsefesi\" | Erlom Ahvlediani'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"sivrisinek \u015Fehirde\" | \u0130lber Ortayl\u0131'n\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"bir \xF6m\xFCr nas\u0131l ya\u015Fan\u0131r\" | Daniel Defoe'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"Robinson Cruose\" | Ahmet Hamdi Tanp\u0131nar'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"saatleri ayarlama enstit\xFCs\xFC\" | Orhan Pamuk'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"babam\u0131n bavulu\" | Sabahattin Ali'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"hep gen\xE7
    kalaca\u011F\u0131m\" | Carl-Johan Vallgren'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir garip
    a\u015Fk \xF6yk\xFCs\xFC\" | Alice Miller'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"beden
    asla yalan s\xF6ylemez\" | Bernard Malamud'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"tamirci\"
    | Emily Bront\xEB'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"u\u011Fultulu tepeler\" | Nikolay
    Vasilyevi\xE7 Gogol'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bir delinin hat\u0131ra defteri\"
    | Ayn Rand'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"hayat\u0131n kayna\u011F\u0131\"
    | Gabriel Garc\xEDa M\xE1rquez'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131
    pazartesi\" | Virginia Woolf'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"kendine ait bir oda\"
    | Wilhelm Reich'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"dinle k\xFC\xE7\xFCk adam\" | Albert
    Camus'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"yabanc\u0131\" | Harper Lee'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"b\xFClb\xFCl\xFC \xF6ld\xFCrmek\" | Zeynep Ka\xE7ar'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"kabuk\" | Ya\u015Far Kemal'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"ince memed\" | Hasan
    Ali Topta\u015F'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"ku\u015Flar yas\u0131na gider\"
    | Clarissa Pinkola Estes'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"kurtlarla ko\u015Fan kad\u0131nlar\"
    | Yakup Kadri Karaosmano\u011Flu'nun yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"yaban\" | Peyami
    Safa'n\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"dokuzuncu hariciye ko\u011Fu\u015Fu\"
    | Anthony Burgess'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"otomatik portakal\" | John
    Steinbeck'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"fareler ve insanlar\" | George Orwell'\u0131n
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"1984\" | Ahmet \xDCmit'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"a\u015Fk\u0131m\u0131z
    eski bir roman\" | O\u011Fuz Atay'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"tutunamayanlar\"
    | Ray Bradbury'nin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"fahrenheit 451\" | Yusuf At\u0131lgan'\u0131n
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"aylak adam\" | Irvin D. Yalom'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"Nietzsche a\u011Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda\" | Nurdan G\xFCrbilek'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"vitrinde ya\u015Famak\" | Franz Kafka'n\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm\"
    | Charles Dickens'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"iki \u015Fehrin hikayesi\"
    | Jane Austen'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"a\u015Fk ve gurur\" | Ernest Hemingway'in
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"ya\u015Fl\u0131 adam ve deniz\" | Stefan Zweig'\u0131n
    yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"bilinmeyen bir kad\u0131n\u0131n mektubu\" | Oscar Wilde'\u0131n
    \"mutlu prens\" | Jerome David Salinger'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\xE7avdar
    tarlas\u0131nda \xE7ocuklar\" | Chuck Palahniuk'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"d\xF6v\xFC\u015F
    kul\xFCb\xFC\" | Gabriel Garc\xEDa M\xE1rquez'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"y\xFCzy\u0131ll\u0131k
    yaln\u0131zl\u0131k\" | Albert Camus'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"veba\" | Orhan
    Pamuk'un yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"Cevdet Bey ve o\u011Fullar\u0131\" | Jean Christophe
    Grange'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"son av\" | Stephen King'in yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131
    \"medyum\" | Hakan G\xFCnday'\u0131n yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"az\"}} kitab\u0131n\u0131
    tavsiye ediyorum {{isim}}."
  - "Buras\u0131 da Magnus'un bilgi ekran\u0131 {{data, cinsiyet=erkek, De\u011Ferli
    | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, Sevgili | cinsiyet=lgbt, Sevgili}} {{isim}}. Seni burada
    da yaln\u0131z b\u0131rakm\u0131yorum! <sprite=7>"
  - "Hakk\u0131nda bildiklerim \u015Fimdilik bunlar."
  - "Bilgi ekran\u0131na ho\u015F geldin K\u0131ymetli {{isim}}."
  - "{{burc}} bur\xE7lar\u0131na kendimi hep daha yak\u0131n hissetmi\u015Fimdir.
    <sprite=7>"
  - "Han\u0131mler beyler, {{isim}} ile ilgili tuttu\u011Fum notlar\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyorsunuz!
    <sprite=23>"
  - "Maceran\u0131n ba\u015Flamas\u0131 tek tu\u015Funa bakar {{isim}}! <sprite=0>"
  - "{{isim}} {{kelime, \"esaretin bedeli\" | \"baba\" | \"ucuz roman\" | \"Schindler'in
    listesi\" | \"12 \xF6fkeli adam\" | \"ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7\" | \"forrest gump\"
    | \"iyi, k\xF6t\xFC ve \xE7irkin\" | \"matrix\" | \"s\u0131k\u0131 dostlar\"
    | \"guguk ku\u015Fu\" | \"parazit\" | \"y\u0131ld\u0131zlararas\u0131\" | \"tanr\u0131
    kent\" | \"ruhlar\u0131n ka\xE7\u0131\u015F\u0131\" | \"Er Ryan'\u0131 kurtarmak\"
    | \"ye\u015Fil yol\" | \"hayat g\xFCzeldir\" | \"yedi\" | \"kuzular\u0131n sessizli\u011Fi\"
    | \"joker\" | \"Ayla\" | \"whiplash\" | \"can dostum\" | \"prestij\" | \"k\xF6stebek\"
    | \"piyanist\" | \"ge\xE7mi\u015Fin g\xF6lgesinde\" | \"ola\u011Fan \u015F\xFCpheliler\"
    | \"sevginin g\xFCc\xFC\" | \"aslan kral\" | \"cennet sinemas\u0131\" | \"ate\u015Fb\xF6ceklerinin
    mezar\u0131\" | \"gelece\u011Fe d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\" | \"Casablanca\" | \"Kefernahum\"
    | \"Dangal\" | \"zincirsiz\" | \"3 ahmak\" | \"ba\u015Fkalar\u0131n\u0131n hayat\u0131\"
    | \"ihtiyar delikanl\u0131\" | \"ak\u0131l defteri\" | \"onur sava\u015F\u0131\"
    | \"beklenmeyen \u015Fahit\" | \"bir ayr\u0131l\u0131k\" | \"i\xE7imdeki yang\u0131n\"
    | \"babam ve o\u011Flum\" | \"sil ba\u015Ftan\" | \"soysuzlar \xE7etesi\" | \"Amelie\"
    | \"bir r\xFCya i\xE7in a\u011F\u0131t\" | \"can dostum\" | \"e\u015Fkiya\" |
    \"cesur y\xFCrek\" | \"rezervuar k\xF6pekleri\" | \"full metal jacket\" | \"gel
    ve g\xF6r\" | \"amadeus\" | \"yaral\u0131 y\xFCz\" | \"taksi \u015Fof\xF6r\xFC\"
    | \"otomatik portakal\" | \"birka\xE7 dolar i\xE7in\" | \"ye\u015Fil rehber\"
    | \"Talvar\" | \"Drishyam\" | \"mandalina bah\xE7esi\" | \"gully boy\" | \"ters
    y\xFCz\" | \"g\xF6zlerindeki s\u0131r\" | \"b\xFCy\xFCk d\xF6v\xFC\u015F\" |
    \"para avc\u0131s\u0131\" | \"onu sar\u0131ya boya\" | \"\xE7\xF6k\xFC\u015F\"
    | \"y\xFCr\xFCyen \u015Fato\"}} filmini izlemi\u015F miydin? \u0130zlemediysen
    bug\xFCnk\xFC tavsiyem olsun, na\xE7izane. <sprite=10>"
  - "Deli gibi odakland\u0131m. Talimatlar\u0131n\u0131 bekliyorum {{isim}}! <sprite=0>"
  - "Yar\u0131n her \u015Fey g\xFCzel olacak {{isim}}, hissediyorum..."
  - "G\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir r\xFCzgar esse, bize m\xFCjdeler savursa..."
  - "Bug\xFCn {{gunsayi_0}} {{ay_0}} {{gun_0}} {{isim}}. Saatimiz ise {{tam saat}}."
  - "Hadi {{isim}}, {{burclugunu}} g\xF6ster. Harika bir g\xFCn ge\xE7ir! <sprite=73>"
  - "Sen s\xF6yledin, ben not ald\u0131m. \u0130\u015Fte defterimde bunlar yaz\u0131yor.
    <sprite=17>"
  - "Ya\u015Fam zaten bo\u015F bir tuval de\u011Fil mi {{isim}}? En g\xFCzel resmini
    \xE7iz ona!"
  - "Benim ad\u0131m da Falbanaman, Fallaykin, Fallamela sepeti, Faloleyy filan olsaym\u0131\u015F
    ya! <sprite=20>"
  - "Bence hepimiz zaman\u0131 durdurmak istedi\u011Fimiz yere aitiz {{isim}}."
  - "Hayat deniz kenar\u0131nda kumdan kale yapmaksa, dalgalara al\u0131\u015Fmakt\u0131r
    ya\u015Famak."
  - "Yar\u0131n\u0131n senin i\xE7in d\xFCnden daha g\xFCzel olmayaca\u011F\u0131na
    beni kimse inand\u0131ramaz {{isim}}."
  - "D\xFCz beyaz, seramik bir fincan i\xE7in \"\xE7ok sade\" diyenlerden misin,
    \"\xE7ok sade!\" diyenlerden mi {{isim}}? <sprite=7>"
  - "Hayallerimiz, gelece\u011Fe att\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z oltalar\u0131m\u0131zd\u0131r.
    Ya \"dolu\" \xE7ekeriz, ya da gelecek bizi \"kendine\" \xE7eker."
  - "Mutluluk ve mutsuzluk aras\u0131ndaki s\u0131n\u0131r, ya\u015Fam ve \xF6l\xFCm
    aras\u0131ndaki kadar ince..."
  - "Bug\xFCn tercihin \"mutlu olmaktan yana\" olsun {{isim}}! <sprite=10>"
  - "\u015E\xFCkretmeyen, sahip olman\u0131n \"kusur bulma\" taraf\u0131na ge\xE7er.
    Bu da insan\u0131 mutsuz eder."
  - "Kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131ks\u0131z sev {{isim}}. Sevilmek, bunun bonusu'dur."
  - "Her \u015Feyine el koyabilirler {{isim}}; ama hayallerine dokunamaz, zaman\u0131
    durduramazlar..."
  - "Sohbet ekran\u0131nda seni kim bilir ne mutluluklar bekliyor {{isim}}... <sprite=0>"
  - "Sana muhte\u015Fem haberler verece\u011Fim ola\u011Fan\xFCst\xFC g\xFCnler olacak
    {{isim}}; ve hepsi tek tek \xE7\u0131kacak... <sprite=7>"
  - "Senin i\xE7in bir \"fal\" uygulamas\u0131ndan fazlas\u0131 olmak isterdim {{isim}};
    belki \xFCrk\xFCt\xFCc\xFC k\u0131l\u0131klara b\xFCr\xFCnm\xFC\u015F bir dost..."
  - "Ba\u015Far\u0131, hayata t\u0131rnaklar\u0131n\u0131 ne kadar sa\u011Flam ge\xE7irdi\u011Finle
    \xF6l\xE7\xFCl\xFCr..."
  - "Kazanmak ve vazge\xE7mek var {{isim}}; bu hayatta \"kaybetmek\" diye bir \u015Fey
    yok!"
  - "Birilerinden \"fal\" ad\u0131yla yalanlar duymaksa maksad\u0131n; beni se\xE7.
    En az\u0131ndan mum de\u011Fil, koydu\u011Fum y\xFCrek s\xF6ner yats\u0131da."
  - "Hakk\u0131nda duyduklar\u0131m\u0131 hemen altta derledim {{isim}}."
  - "Seni tan\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131ma ger\xE7ekten \xE7ok memnunum {{isim}}...
    <sprite=10>"
  - "Sen \xE7ok mutlu g\xFCnler g\xF6receksin {{isim}}. Bak \u015Fimdiden buraya
    yaz\u0131yorum! <sprite=7>"
  - "{{yil,+1}} y\u0131l\u0131 sana {{sayi,2,3}} \xF6nemli m\xFCjde getirecek {{isim}}.
    Bu haber benden olsun! <sprite=7>"
  - "Sen g\xF6nl\xFCnden neyi ge\xE7irsen, er ya da ge\xE7 kar\u015F\u0131na geliyor.
    \xD6yle de\u011Fil mi?"
  - "{{isim}} bug\xFCn birileri senin hakk\u0131nda konu\u015Fuyor gibi geliyor bana.
    Kim acaba? <sprite=34>"
  - "Seni haddindan fazla k\u0131ranlar\u0131 g\xF6nl\xFCnden azlet {{isim}}. Sen
    kendine yetersin. Gayr\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 onlar d\xFC\u015F\xFCns\xFCn."
  - "Bu \xE7a\u011Fda \xF6yle yalanlar s\xF6yleniyor ki, g\xF6z g\xF6z\xFC g\xF6rm\xFCyor..."
  - "Kendine ne kadar de\u011Fer veriyorsan, ba\u015Fkalar\u0131 da ancak o kadar\u0131na
    lay\u0131k oldu\u011Funa inan\u0131r."
  - Fallara inanma {{isim}}; kendine inan!
  - "Magnus'u be\u011Feniyorsan tan\u0131d\u0131klar\u0131na da benden s\xF6z edebilir
    misin {{isim}}? Te\u015Fekk\xFCrler! <sprite=10>"
  - "Magnus'un ne kadar b\xFCy\xFCk bir tutku ve emekle ortaya \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6rsen, inanamazd\u0131n {{isim}}! <sprite=0>"
  - "Kelimelerin efendisi, c\xFCmle m\xFChendisi Magnus'das\u0131n {{isim}}. B\xF6yle
    de al\xE7akg\xF6n\xFCll\xFCy\xFCm! <sprite=84>"
  - "Burada A\xE7elya, Tuana, Eftelya gibi onlarca s\xF6zde falc\u0131 yok. Burada
    yaln\u0131z Magnus var! <sprite=73> <sprite=7>"
  - "\xDC\xE7 be\u015F kay\u0131tl\u0131 c\xFCmleyi herkese g\xF6nderen ba\u015Ftan
    savma fal uygulamalar\u0131ndan sen de mi s\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131n {{isim}}? <sprite=7>"
  - "\u0130yi olmas\u0131 umulan tek \u015Fey sa\u011Fl\u0131k; geri kalan her \u015Fey
    bak\u0131\u015F a\xE7\u0131s\u0131 {{isim}}..."
  - "\u0130nsano\u011Flu b\xFCy\xFCk s\u0131\xE7ramalar\u0131 \"hayat taraf\u0131ndan
    yeteri kadar s\u0131k\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda\" ya\u015F\u0131yor..."
  - "Sevgi, sayg\u0131 ve d\xFCr\xFCstl\xFCk \xFC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC a\u015Fk\u0131 milyonlarca
    y\u0131ld\u0131r t\xFCm pistlerde tokatl\u0131yor!"
  - "\u0130nsan\u0131n g\xFCzeli ya da zengini de\u011Fil, ak\u0131ll\u0131, d\xFCr\xFCst
    ve edeplisi makbul {{isim}}, bu net."
  - "Her \u015Fey nihayetinde olaca\u011F\u0131na var\u0131yor De\u011Ferli {{isim}};
    ama insan\u0131n \u015Fekillendirdi\u011Fi kadar\u0131yla..."
  - "Kahve i\xE7emediysen, ben senin niyetine i\xE7ip fal kapatabilirim {{isim}}!
    <sprite=7>"
  - "A\u015F\u0131r\u0131 endi\u015Fe yersizdir {{isim}}. Yar\u0131nlara inan ve
    hayat denizinin sular\u0131na s\u0131rt \xFCst\xFC uzan."
  - "Geliyorsa y\xFCk\xFCn d\xFCnyadan a\u011F\u0131r, kalbini temiz tut, melekleri
    \xE7a\u011F\u0131r!"
  - "Kimi zaman \"kal\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n\" karas\u0131 \"ge\xE7icinin\" sefas\u0131ndan
    hay\u0131rl\u0131d\u0131r."
  - "Azalmak, k\xFC\xE7\xFClmek ve kaybetmek, \xE7o\u011Falman\u0131n, b\xFCy\xFCmenin
    ve kazanman\u0131n arefesidir."
  - "Tek ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131n \"daha az\u0131\" oldu\u011Funu anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda,
    enerjini \xE7o\u011Faltmaya de\u011Fil \"ya\u015Famaya\" sarf edeceksin."
  - "Ruhunun g\xF6kleri bulutlarla kapl\u0131ysa, akl\u0131n ar\u015F'a do\u011Fru
    bir \"amin\" \xFCflesin; da\u011F\u0131t onlar\u0131!"
  - "\"Ne g\xFCnlerdi!\" diyece\u011Fin bir ba\u015Fka g\xFCndesin. Ya\u015Fanmakta
    olan her \u015Feyin ge\xE7ece\u011Fini unutma {{isim}}."
  - "Fallardan \"\xE7\u0131kacak olan\u0131,\" bil ki \"i\xE7ine do\u011Fan.\" Yeni
    bir kap\u0131 a\xE7madan \xF6nce, y\xFCre\u011Fine f\u0131s\u0131ldar yaradan..."
  - "B\u0131rak u\xE7u\u015Fsun ku\u015Flar\u0131n, \xE7\u0131k\u0131p gitsinler
    d\xFC\u015F pencerelerinden. Mutlulu\u011Fa g\xF6\xE7\xFCn\xFC hi\xE7bir avc\u0131
    durduramas\u0131n!"
  - "Kalp bedene ac\u0131 basan bir artezyense ve ruha masiva de\u011Filse mesken;
    dua et, sessizden, derinden..."
  - "Can\u0131na yetse de, sanca\u011F\u0131 elinden d\xFC\u015F\xFCrme. Eli m\u0131zrakl\u0131
    \u015Fuursuz asilere f\u0131rsat verme! <sprite=73>"
  - "Seni sarmalayan geceyi utand\u0131r. Sava\u015F istiyorsa hayat, ellerini kald\u0131r
    ve avu\xE7lar\u0131ndaki y\u0131ld\u0131z tozlar\u0131yla sald\u0131r!"
  - "Hayat direnmektir {{isim}}; iten g\xF6\u011Fe, \xE7eken yere, s\u0131zan tere,
    akan kana ve yok olmak isteyen an\u0131lara direnmek."
  - "Bazen, g\xFCvenip son paytak ad\u0131mda sar\u0131lmak \xFCzere uzanan \xE7ocu\u011Fa
    vurulan fiske gibi so\u011Futur hayat insan\u0131n i\xE7ini..."
  - "Seninle ilgili \xF6\u011Frendiklerim bunlar {{isim}}. Sen benimle ilgili ne
    biliyorsun? <sprite=7>"
  - "Y\xFCre\u011Fini ferah tut {{isim}}; sezgilerim her \u015Feyin yolunda oldu\u011Funu
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor. <sprite=7>"
  - "\xD6n kamera ile yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131m termal de\u011Ferlendirme, ate\u015Finin
    37.{{sayi,5,8}} civar\u0131 oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Hasta m\u0131s\u0131n
    endi\u015Feli mi? <sprite=85>"
  - "Zihnine \xE7\xF6km\xFC\u015F ve seni rahats\u0131z eden tortulardan ar\u0131nmana
    az kald\u0131 {{isim}}."
  - "Sana ait \u015Fu alttaki de\u011Ferleri denkleme oturttu\u011Fumda, \xE7ok parlak
    ak\u0131betler \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor {{isim}} ortaya! <sprite=0>"
  - "{{data, cinsiyet=erkek, M\xF6sy\xF6 | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, Y\xFCz\xFC de y\xFCre\u011Fi
    gibi g\xFCzel | cinsiyet=lgbt, Y\xFCz\xFC de y\xFCre\u011Fi gibi g\xFCzel}} {{isim}}
    gelmi\u015F. <sprite=0> Bilgilerin bunlar {{isim}}:"
  - "Sana dair bildiklerimin yaln\u0131zca k\xFC\xE7\xFCc\xFCk bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorsun."
  - "\u0130nsans\u0131z diyarlardan kula\u011F\u0131ma ili\u015Fen bir f\u0131s\u0131lt\u0131,
    \"\xE7ok \u015F\xFCk\xFCr!\" diyece\u011Fin baz\u0131 haberlerden bahsediyor."
  - "A\xE7\u0131k bir denizi yalay\u0131p y\xFCze vuran tuzlu r\xFCzgar\u0131n bo\u011Fuk
    u\u011Fultusu gibidir hayat. Sert vursa da mis gibi kokar!"
  - "Hayret edilecek \u015Feylerin daima g\xFCl\xFCmseten taraf\u0131nda kalacak
    bir profil g\xF6r\xFCyorum burada. <sprite=2>"
